WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Connecting rod cap
What it does: Allows the rod to be installed around the crankpin and retains the bearing.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Connecting rod cap
How it works: The bolts hold the joint under load.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Connecting rod cap
How it moves: Moves with the rod big end; does not rotate independently.
